OL,3,GNEWSAWill e-bike scheme be a boon or a 
OL,4,Ablight on Hull?                        
OL,6,FThe possibility of Hull adopting a     
OL,7,Fcity-wide e-bikes rental scheme has    
OL,8,Fopened a debate about the pros and cons
OL,9,Fof such an initiative.                 
OL,11,FProponents say e-bikes are clean,      
OL,12,Fefficient and relatively cheap.        
OL,14,FBut detractors say there are issues    
OL,15,Fover the safety of both cyclists and   
OL,16,Fpedestrians, the bikes being dumped,   
OL,17,Fand the infrastructure demands to make 
OL,18,Fthe scheme work.                       
OL,20,FThe city council said it was "doing a  
OL,21,Flot of infrastructure rebuilding".     
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
